483
00:19:04,930 --> 00:19:06,410
"It wasn't you.

484
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:07,870
You didn't kill anyone.

485
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,310
You've been wronged."

486
00:19:12,190 --> 00:19:12,860
Why?

487
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:16,200
Because without
that little voice comforting him,

488
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:17,100
he'd have to face the truth

489
00:19:17,100 --> 00:19:18,100
that he's a murderer

490
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:19,410
with no humanity,

491
00:19:20,170 --> 00:19:21,790
and he couldn't live with himself.

492
00:19:21,790 --> 00:19:22,150
Here.

493
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:23,480
Have some water.

494
00:19:23,540 --> 00:19:24,600
Thank you, Mentor.

495
00:19:28,410 --> 00:19:28,980
It's hot.

496
00:19:30,130 --> 00:19:30,780
Lihui.

497
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,210
You're still young.

498
00:19:34,210 --> 00:19:35,210
You don't need to,

499
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:36,640
and it's not worth pinning your whole life

500
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,770
on these people

501
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:38,880
and these cases.

502
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:40,770
Just go.

503
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:44,640
A whole good life is waiting for you.

504
00:19:48,970 --> 00:19:49,900
What do you mean?

505
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,490
The court's called several times.

506
00:19:53,050 --> 00:19:54,780
They want to transfer you back.

507
00:19:54,930 --> 00:19:56,990
They say you're overqualified here.

508
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:58,610
And honestly, that's true.

509
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:00,730
You have a PhD now.

510
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:01,880
Besides,

511
00:20:02,250 --> 00:20:03,640
no woman has ever

512
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,290
stayed here for eight years.

513
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:08,970
It's time to go back.

514
00:20:10,450 --> 00:20:11,250
But you've been

515
00:20:11,250 --> 00:20:12,580
here over twenty years.

516
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:14,980
Don't compare yourself to me.

517
00:20:15,120 --> 00:20:16,690
I'm serving a life sentence.

518
00:20:16,690 --> 00:20:17,160
If I leave here,

519
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,360
where would I even go?

520
00:20:19,510 --> 00:20:21,010
You're over thirty.

521
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:23,600
Don't you want to start a family

522
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:25,320
and live a normal life?

523
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:29,770
I haven't thought about it.

524
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:30,700
I'm not leaving.

525
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:33,410
I already told the court

526
00:20:33,560 --> 00:20:34,550
you agreed to go back.

527
00:20:34,550 --> 00:20:36,150
You're leaving in a few days.

528
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:39,100
Who gave you the right to decide for me?

529
00:20:39,100 --> 00:20:41,030
You didn't even talk to me about it.

530
00:20:41,530 --> 00:20:42,770
How many times have I talked to you?

531
00:20:42,770 --> 00:20:43,840
Do you ever listen?

532
00:20:44,770 --> 00:20:45,600
This time, I'm making

533
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,320
the call.

534
00:20:46,340 --> 00:20:47,740
Think whatever you want.

535
00:20:50,250 --> 00:20:51,250
It's not up to you.

536
00:20:51,970 --> 00:20:52,900
I'm not leaving!

537
00:21:18,360 --> 00:21:19,560
I didn't kill anyone.

538
00:21:20,490 --> 00:21:21,560
I've been wronged.

539
00:21:25,210 --> 00:21:26,540
I never killed anybody.

540
00:21:37,660 --> 00:21:38,600
Here, have another bite.

541
00:21:38,600 --> 00:21:39,530
Grandma made something good?

542
00:21:39,530 --> 00:21:39,860
Here.

543
00:21:40,970 --> 00:21:41,560
Eat.

544
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:42,710
You're back.

545
00:21:42,710 --> 00:21:44,900
I told you not to make it spicy.

546
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:46,490
It's delicious.

547
00:21:46,730 --> 00:21:49,390
-What’s wrong with spicy food?
-Is it too spicy?

548
00:21:49,650 --> 00:21:50,780
No spice, no flavor.

549
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:52,320
It tastes good.

550
00:21:52,320 --> 00:21:52,980
Spit it out.

551
00:21:53,600 --> 00:21:54,210
We grew up

552
00:21:54,210 --> 00:21:55,290
eating spicy food.

553
00:21:55,310 --> 00:21:56,370
What's the matter?

554
00:21:56,490 --> 00:21:57,210
Didn't you?

555
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:58,490
Let me tell you,

556
00:21:58,930 --> 00:22:00,050
if I don't have chili peppers,

557
00:22:00,050 --> 00:22:01,850
I can't even stir a wok properly.

558
00:22:05,450 --> 00:22:07,240
The kid's stomach can't handle it.

559
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:08,760
Girls are delicate.

560
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:12,690
If it were a boy,

561
00:22:12,690 --> 00:22:14,660
I'd have taken him back
to raise him long ago.

562
00:22:14,660 --> 00:22:16,840
Instead, I'm stuck here
taking crap from you.

563
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,300
What are you trying to say?

564
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:21,290
At first, I didn't even want a kid.

565
00:22:21,290 --> 00:22:22,090
You insisted.

566
00:22:22,730 --> 00:22:23,450
Now that she's here,

567
00:22:23,450 --> 00:22:24,970
you're not happy either, are you?

568
00:22:24,970 --> 00:22:26,230
Who am I doing this for?

569
00:22:26,630 --> 00:22:27,400
I'm doing it

570
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:29,130
for the honor of your Yu family.

571
00:22:31,250 --> 00:22:32,290
Tell me,

572
00:22:32,730 --> 00:22:34,080
who told you to go be

573
00:22:34,080 --> 00:22:36,120
someone else's live-in son-in-law?

574
00:22:36,120 --> 00:22:37,450
Who are you gonna blame?

575
00:22:38,640 --> 00:22:39,250
Listen

576
00:22:39,250 --> 00:22:40,530
to yourself.

577
00:22:43,050 --> 00:22:44,050
I'll take you out to eat.

578
00:22:44,050 --> 00:22:44,780
Don't leave.

579
00:22:45,050 --> 00:22:45,930
Listen to me,

580
00:22:46,540 --> 00:22:47,220
look,

581
00:22:47,250 --> 00:22:48,320
Haohao's body

582
00:22:48,340 --> 00:22:49,340
is like that.

583
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:51,930
We can't waste the second-child quota.

584
00:22:51,930 --> 00:22:52,880
Hurry up

585
00:22:52,930 --> 00:22:54,430
and have a boy.

586
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,140
Where's Diandian?

587
00:23:07,140 --> 00:23:08,540
She's asleep with my mom.

588
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:14,560
I've told you so many times.

589
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:16,760
She should be sleeping on her own by now.

590
00:23:27,490 --> 00:23:28,360
That woman came to

591
00:23:28,360 --> 00:23:29,800
my office again this afternoon.

592
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:31,530
This time she brought a lawyer.

593
00:23:33,280 --> 00:23:35,340
Look at the one your dad ended up with—

594
00:23:36,330 --> 00:23:38,250
divorced him the moment he retired.

595
00:23:38,250 --> 00:23:40,120
But he can't just give away
that military housing property to her.

596
00:23:40,120 --> 00:23:41,520
I ended up with a good one.

597
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:42,450
When I was single,

598
00:23:42,450 --> 00:23:44,210
my dad had a whole building to himself.

599
00:23:44,210 --> 00:23:45,540
Now that I'm remarried,

600
00:23:45,560 --> 00:23:47,360
he's stuck in a retirement home.

601
00:23:49,120 --> 00:23:50,250
Why do you talk like that?

602
00:23:50,250 --> 00:23:51,110
Did I force him?

603
00:23:52,050 --> 00:23:52,930
He wants to be there

604
00:23:52,930 --> 00:23:53,800
because his buddies are there.

605
00:23:53,800 --> 00:23:55,640
They can play mahjong and chat together.

606
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:56,770
My mom's here doing laundry, cooking,

607
00:23:56,770 --> 00:23:57,640
taking care of the kid.

608
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,360
If I hired a nanny,

609
00:23:58,360 --> 00:23:59,560
would you even agree?

610
00:24:09,890 --> 00:24:11,010
Get me that lawyer's

611
00:24:11,010 --> 00:24:11,560
name.

612
00:24:12,770 --> 00:24:13,400
What for?

613
00:24:14,030 --> 00:24:15,490
You're on the criminal division,

614
00:24:15,490 --> 00:24:16,820
and he's a civil lawyer.

615
00:24:18,180 --> 00:24:18,770
In Binjiang, lawyers

616
00:24:18,770 --> 00:24:20,230
can't pretend not to see me

617
00:24:20,360 --> 00:24:21,090
that easily.

618
00:24:22,450 --> 00:24:24,080
Fine, Chief Judge Yu.

619
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,170
When are you getting promoted

620
00:24:26,170 --> 00:24:27,730
to the Supreme Court in Beijing?

621
00:24:27,730 --> 00:24:29,190
Don't bring that up again.

622
00:24:29,550 --> 00:24:30,810
How's studying going?

623
00:24:31,050 --> 00:24:31,910
Same as always.

624
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:37,010
My mom brought up

625
00:24:37,010 --> 00:24:38,340
that thing again today.

626
00:24:50,360 --> 00:24:51,020
What thing?

627
00:24:55,150 --> 00:24:57,150
I've been thinking about it myself.

628
00:24:57,930 --> 00:24:59,330
Diandian's still young.

629
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,570
Having a brother

630
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:01,970
or sister

631
00:25:03,120 --> 00:25:03,880
to grow up together.

632
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:04,940
That would be nice.

633
00:25:11,530 --> 00:25:12,190
Yu Gaoyuan,

634
00:25:13,050 --> 00:25:13,800
I'm a person.

635
00:25:14,690 --> 00:25:15,450
I'm not a tool for you

636
00:25:15,450 --> 00:25:16,780
to carry out your ideas.

637
00:25:17,210 --> 00:25:18,600
You want to go to Beijing,

638
00:25:18,600 --> 00:25:20,130
and I study for grad school.

639
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,400
Now you want a second child,

640
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,560
so I have to keep having kids

641
00:25:22,560 --> 00:25:23,210
until I pop out

642
00:25:23,210 --> 00:25:24,930
a boy for the Yu family.

643
00:25:26,770 --> 00:25:27,600
We're family.

644
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,480
Have you ever thought about me?

645
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,970
What I want? What I hope for?

646
00:25:30,970 --> 00:25:31,490
What I like?

647
00:25:31,490 --> 00:25:32,400
Have you ever asked me?

648
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:32,880
Isn't this about

649
00:25:32,880 --> 00:25:34,400
what's best for Diandian?

650
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:35,930
What are you talking about?

651
00:25:45,010 --> 00:25:46,140
You know it exactly.

652
00:26:08,320 --> 00:26:08,880
Mr. Guo.

653
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:11,510
Lihui, you're here too.

654
00:26:11,510 --> 00:26:12,360
I'm saved.

655
00:26:12,930 --> 00:26:13,640
What's going on?

656
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,010
You look like a mess.

657
00:26:16,050 --> 00:26:17,530
It's that Yan Jicai guy.

658
00:26:18,050 --> 00:26:19,360
He's driving me crazy.

659
00:26:19,800 --> 00:26:20,730
Stubborn as a rock.

660
00:26:20,730 --> 00:26:21,800
He won't listen to reason.

661
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:22,730
The moment he got here,

662
00:26:22,730 --> 00:26:23,970
he was put in solitary,

663
00:26:23,970 --> 00:26:25,400
and started banging his head
against the wall once out.

664
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,230
Like a madman.

665
00:26:26,410 --> 00:26:27,730
He's only been here a few days,

666
00:26:27,730 --> 00:26:29,320
and he's already
been locked up three times.

667
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:29,690
He just keeps

668
00:26:29,690 --> 00:26:31,290
yelling that he's innocent.

669
00:26:31,640 --> 00:26:32,010
Well,

670
00:26:32,360 --> 00:26:34,120
I've got no idea what to do with him.

671
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:35,120
What do you think?

672
00:26:35,770 --> 00:26:36,640
Is he innocent or not?

673
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,250
Mr. Guo,

674
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:38,490
you've been here

675
00:26:38,490 --> 00:26:39,550
over twenty years.

676
00:26:39,690 --> 00:26:41,320
Have you ever met a truly innocent one?

677
00:26:41,320 --> 00:26:43,120
Everyone who comes in
claims they're innocent.

678
00:26:43,120 --> 00:26:43,720
Thank you.

679
00:26:44,160 --> 00:26:44,620
Mr. Guo,

680
00:26:45,240 --> 00:26:45,700
you just

681
00:26:46,270 --> 00:26:47,160
go talk to him.

682
00:26:47,770 --> 00:26:48,490
Tell him

683
00:26:48,690 --> 00:26:49,880
the prosecutor already knows

684
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:50,740
about his case.

685
00:26:50,770 --> 00:26:51,690
Calm him down,

686
00:26:52,120 --> 00:26:53,310
make him accept reality

687
00:26:53,310 --> 00:26:54,400
and focus on his reform.

688
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,860
Give it a couple of months,

689
00:26:56,010 --> 00:26:56,840
once he's settled

690
00:26:56,840 --> 00:26:58,010
and his hope dies down,

691
00:26:58,010 --> 00:26:59,210
he'll stop making trouble.

692
00:26:59,210 --> 00:26:59,730
Okay.

693
00:27:00,450 --> 00:27:01,580
I'll be there later.

694
00:27:03,800 --> 00:27:04,930
Lihui, you come too.

695
00:27:05,250 --> 00:27:07,050
She's more convincing than you.

696
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:08,290
Lihui can't go.

697
00:27:09,420 --> 00:27:11,020
She's going back to the city.

698
00:27:12,740 --> 00:27:14,670
Really getting transferred back?

699
00:27:15,640 --> 00:27:16,920
That'll make our job

700
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:17,930
even harder.

701
00:27:18,330 --> 00:27:19,130
I'll be there.

702
00:27:35,360 --> 00:27:36,080
Director Sun told us

703
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:36,880
to let you know

704
00:27:37,360 --> 00:27:39,760
that this inmate is especially dangerous.

705
00:27:40,560 --> 00:27:41,250
Yan Jicai,

706
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:42,250
right?

707
00:27:45,120 --> 00:27:46,320
Ms. Zhang and I

708
00:27:46,690 --> 00:27:48,220
are resident prosecutors.

709
00:27:48,970 --> 00:27:51,030
We're here to accept inmate appeals.

710
00:27:51,650 --> 00:27:52,980
Can you follow the rules

711
00:27:53,410 --> 00:27:54,890
during our talk?

712
00:27:55,800 --> 00:27:56,490
Who are you?

713
00:27:56,970 --> 00:27:58,250
I'm Guo Dajie.

714
00:27:58,450 --> 00:27:59,730
She's Zhang Lihui.

715
00:28:00,050 --> 00:28:00,530
We're here

716
00:28:00,530 --> 00:28:02,080
to hear your appeal.

717
00:28:03,080 --> 00:28:03,930
I'm innocent!

718
00:28:03,950 --> 00:28:05,530
Yan Jicai! Get up!

719
00:28:05,730 --> 00:28:06,360
-I’m innocent!
-Yan Jicai!

720
00:28:06,360 --> 00:28:07,360
-I'm innocent!
-Yan Jicai!

721
00:28:07,360 --> 00:28:08,080
I'm innocent!

722
00:28:08,080 --> 00:28:08,680
Yan Jicai,

723
00:28:08,980 --> 00:28:09,930
if you keep acting like this,

724
00:28:09,930 --> 00:28:12,130
we'll have to send you back to your cell.

725
00:28:13,980 --> 00:28:14,770
Do you want that,

726
00:28:14,770 --> 00:28:16,900
or do you want to talk with us properly?

727
00:28:18,210 --> 00:28:19,160
I'll talk properly.

728
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:19,640
Get up.

729
00:28:20,560 --> 00:28:21,450
Let's talk.

730
00:28:21,510 --> 00:28:22,050
Get up.

731
00:28:26,350 --> 00:28:27,550
Here, wipe your head.

732
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:30,840
Yan Jicai,

733
00:28:31,490 --> 00:28:32,800
you got a reprieve for raping

734
00:28:32,800 --> 00:28:34,360
and murdering a young woman

735
00:28:34,380 --> 00:28:35,480
who took your taxi.

736
00:28:36,460 --> 00:28:38,620
The law has been very lenient with you.

737
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:39,810
You're forty now

738
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:42,300
and you've served five years.

739
00:28:43,360 --> 00:28:45,530
If you accept your sentence,

740
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:46,640
behave, and reform,

741
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:48,570
in a few years you can be commuted to

742
00:28:48,690 --> 00:28:50,010
a fixed-term sentence.

743
00:28:50,010 --> 00:28:51,250
After a dozen or twenty years,

744
00:28:51,250 --> 00:28:52,290
you'll be out.

745
00:28:52,450 --> 00:28:54,450
You'll still be under sixty,

746
00:28:54,530 --> 00:28:56,080
with half your life left.

747
00:28:57,400 --> 00:28:59,010
But if you keep resisting-

748
00:28:59,010 --> 00:29:00,210
I'm innocent!

749
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,800
I'm innocent!

750
00:29:02,690 --> 00:29:04,490
And I know who the real killer is.

751
00:29:06,450 --> 00:29:07,160
Really?

752
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:10,290
His name is Jia Peng.

753
00:29:10,800 --> 00:29:11,400
Like me,

754
00:29:12,600 --> 00:29:13,930
he drove a taxi in Nanlu.

755
00:29:15,640 --> 00:29:16,700
You're from Nanlu?

756
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:20,370
This real killer, Jia Peng,

757
00:29:20,490 --> 00:29:21,080
was arrested

758
00:29:21,080 --> 00:29:22,600
a year after I was.

759
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,560
I read

760
00:29:24,560 --> 00:29:25,490
about his case

761
00:29:26,360 --> 00:29:27,600
in a prison magazine.

762
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:29,730
His method

763
00:29:29,970 --> 00:29:31,010
was exactly the same

764
00:29:31,010 --> 00:29:31,730
as mine.

765
00:29:33,640 --> 00:29:34,770
So you're saying

766
00:29:35,450 --> 00:29:37,220
you solved your own case

767
00:29:37,250 --> 00:29:38,510
by reading an article?

768
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:40,240
Just look at my case file,

769
00:29:40,690 --> 00:29:41,930
then read that article—

770
00:29:41,930 --> 00:29:42,840
anyone would see

771
00:29:42,840 --> 00:29:43,880
it wasn't me.

772
00:29:44,600 --> 00:29:46,060
Where's that article now?

773
00:29:46,320 --> 00:29:47,080
I tore it out

774
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:48,140
and kept it with me.

775
00:29:48,450 --> 00:29:49,490
It's in my cell.

776
00:29:50,210 --> 00:29:51,490
You can send someone to get it.

777
00:29:51,490 --> 00:29:53,350
Then what about your confession?

778
00:29:53,800 --> 00:29:54,840
They tortured me,

779
00:29:55,520 --> 00:29:56,450
beat it out of me.

780
00:30:00,450 --> 00:30:01,120
Yan Jicai,

781
00:30:01,530 --> 00:30:03,050
we can forget the case file

782
00:30:03,970 --> 00:30:04,900
and the article.

783
00:30:05,360 --> 00:30:06,080
Just tell us

784
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:07,700
what really happened.

785
00:30:08,120 --> 00:30:09,120
Tell us the truth.

786
00:30:10,780 --> 00:30:11,340
According to

787
00:30:11,340 --> 00:30:13,910
Article 120 of the Criminal Procedure Law

788
00:30:14,270 --> 00:30:16,200
of the People's Republic of China,

789
00:30:16,490 --> 00:30:17,950
the verdict is as follows:

790
00:30:17,970 --> 00:30:19,430
Defendant Qian Xingliang

791
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:20,930
is found not guilty

792
00:30:20,930 --> 00:30:22,400
and released immediately.

793
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,400
Court adjourned.

794
00:30:30,290 --> 00:30:31,560
Xingliang.

795
00:30:33,260 --> 00:30:34,340
Xingliang.

796
00:30:35,640 --> 00:30:36,290
Sister.

797
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:50,080
Xingliang.

798
00:30:50,250 --> 00:30:50,800
Sister.

799
00:30:52,400 --> 00:30:53,130
Where's Mom?

800
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:54,400
Mom...

801
00:30:58,930 --> 00:31:00,520
Mom is gone.

802
00:31:19,050 --> 00:31:20,450
Comrade Qian Xingliang,

803
00:31:20,800 --> 00:31:21,690
we failed to

804
00:31:21,690 --> 00:31:23,450
uphold the final standard.

805
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:25,210
You were wronged,

806
00:31:25,230 --> 00:31:26,630
your freedom taken away.

807
00:31:27,120 --> 00:31:28,170
On behalf of the court,

808
00:31:28,170 --> 00:31:29,770
I formally apologize to you.

809
00:31:29,930 --> 00:31:30,530
I'm sorry.

810
00:31:36,320 --> 00:31:37,530
We mishandled

811
00:31:37,840 --> 00:31:39,050
the case.

812
00:31:39,730 --> 00:31:40,530
We were wrong.

813
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:44,690
We apologize to you.

814
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:57,360
On behalf of
the Binjiang City Procuratorate,

815
00:31:57,360 --> 00:31:58,420
I apologize to you.

816
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,020
Thank you, sir.

817
00:32:04,560 --> 00:32:05,420
Thank you, sir.

818
00:32:05,770 --> 00:32:06,630
Thank you, sir.

819
00:32:09,250 --> 00:32:10,580
Hello, Qian Xingliang.

820
00:32:11,600 --> 00:32:13,130
I was the judge on your case.

821
00:32:13,840 --> 00:32:15,100
My name is Xia Yingjie.

822
00:32:16,360 --> 00:32:17,690
On my own behalf,

823
00:32:19,770 --> 00:32:21,490
I sincerely apologize to you.

824
00:32:23,020 --> 00:32:24,620
You were wrongly convicted.

825
00:32:25,560 --> 00:32:26,160
I'm sorry.

826
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:28,530
Truly sorry.

827
00:32:32,690 --> 00:32:33,560
Thank you.

828
00:32:34,600 --> 00:32:35,250
Thank you.

829
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:36,640
Thank you.

830
00:33:02,010 --> 00:33:02,670
Xingliang.

831
00:33:02,800 --> 00:33:03,450
Let's go.

832
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:05,900
Our Xingliang is back!

833
00:33:05,930 --> 00:33:06,970
He's innocent!

834
00:33:06,970 --> 00:33:07,490
Xingliang.

835
00:33:07,050 --> 00:33:08,120
[Welcome Back, Xingliang
Innocence Restored]

836
00:33:08,490 --> 00:33:09,730
On behalf of the whole village,

837
00:33:09,730 --> 00:33:10,530
welcome home!

838
00:33:10,880 --> 00:33:12,800
Finally, justice is done.

839
00:33:13,290 --> 00:33:14,360
Your name is cleared.

840
00:33:14,360 --> 00:33:15,420
Congratulations.

841
00:33:17,640 --> 00:33:18,640
You've suffered.

842
00:33:19,530 --> 00:33:21,400
Our Xingliang is innocent.

843
00:33:51,080 --> 00:33:51,560
How...

844
00:33:53,880 --> 00:33:54,770
did Mom pass?

845
00:33:56,010 --> 00:33:57,450
Mom couldn't take it—

846
00:33:58,290 --> 00:33:59,640
the gossip, the stares.

847
00:34:00,710 --> 00:34:02,440
She cried until she went blind,

848
00:34:03,350 --> 00:34:04,830
and died of a broken heart.

849
00:34:14,080 --> 00:34:14,739
Xingliang!

850
00:34:17,010 --> 00:34:17,929
Xingliang!

851
00:34:19,159 --> 00:34:19,969
Xingliang.

852
00:34:21,889 --> 00:34:22,760
You are?

853
00:34:23,760 --> 00:34:24,510
Tan Xin.

854
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:27,080
Your defense lawyer from the first trial.

855
00:34:27,080 --> 00:34:27,810
Forgot, huh?

856
00:34:27,929 --> 00:34:29,010
Lawyer Tan?

857
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:32,409
If I hadn't told you

858
00:34:32,429 --> 00:34:33,600
what to say in court back then,

859
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:35,659
would they have given you a reprieve?

860
00:34:37,080 --> 00:34:37,940
I remember now.

861
00:34:39,280 --> 00:34:40,280
Just got out, huh?

862
00:34:40,350 --> 00:34:41,210
You need money.

863
00:34:41,429 --> 00:34:42,330
No, I can't.

864
00:34:42,889 --> 00:34:45,350
The village said
they'll give us subsidies.

865
00:34:45,530 --> 00:34:46,190
Subsidies?

866
00:34:46,850 --> 00:34:47,560
That measly subsidy

867
00:34:47,560 --> 00:34:48,699
and you're satisfied?

868
00:34:48,699 --> 00:34:49,199
Your case

869
00:34:49,199 --> 00:34:50,929
is a complete miscarriage of justice.

870
00:34:50,929 --> 00:34:52,190
Eight years in prison.

871
00:34:52,290 --> 00:34:53,020
For nothing?

872
00:34:55,080 --> 00:34:55,540
Then...

873
00:34:56,489 --> 00:34:57,010
Then

874
00:34:57,530 --> 00:34:58,860
what am I supposed to do?

875
00:34:59,930 --> 00:35:00,930
Court president,

