1091
00:42:46,600 --> 00:42:47,730
I don't know either.

1092
00:42:48,240 --> 00:42:49,450
But I think it all

1093
00:42:50,050 --> 00:42:51,180
could be explained.

1094
00:42:51,540 --> 00:42:52,410
The motive doesn't

1095
00:42:52,410 --> 00:42:53,810
